  "description": "Chulsoo is about to get discharged from the army tomorrow, but one more level of this mobile game before bed won’t hurt, will it? Oh! A free loot box, maybe there will be something good in there! Woah! What the…where is he? An elven mage, a dark elf spy, a halfling captain? Who are these people?! Tomorrow was supposed to be Chulsoo’s first day of freedom, how is he going to get out of this absurd fantasy world…? He should have never gone for that free loot! Now this ordinary human is going to have to make his way through this extraordinary land in “Deus Bard Machina 2: The Chosen Misfits”!",
